    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH HEAVENLY HAVOC</h2>Experience the adrenaline rush of Angelstruck, a dynamic 2D shooter action roguelite. Assume the mantle of an Underworld angel and engage in a fierce battle against waves of celestial enemies descending from above.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576460/extras/ce22a5b018fe7b062155d1efa342497a.poster.avif?t=1720208305\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576460/extras/ce22a5b018fe7b062155d1efa342497a.webm?t=1720208305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576460/extras/ce22a5b018fe7b062155d1efa342497a.mp4?t=1720208305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE FORMIDABLE BOSSES</h2>As you embark on your journey, fortify your abilities to overcome the relentless challenges presented by swarms of adversaries and imposing bosses. Your mission as an angel of the Underworld demands continuous growth to emerge victorious.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE WISELY AND ELEVATE YOUR ABILITIES</h2>In each run, strategic choices await as you accumulate experience and select perks to enhance your prowess. Elevate these perks to unlock augmented versions, granting you additional abilities that turn the tide of battle in your favor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNEARTH DEVASTATING ABILITIES THROUGH SYNERGY</h2>Delve into the art of synergy by combining two compatible, max-powered perks. Witness the birth of awe-inspiring new abilities that wreak havoc on your opponents, showcasing your mastery of the celestial battlefield.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576460/extras/b2281d05dba132516400a1f020916b6a.avif?t=1720208305\" width=700 height=584 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAP REWARDS, FORGE DESTINY</h2>With each run, your performance reaps its rewards in the form of credits. These valuable credits can be strategically employed to unlock permanent abilities and procure new weapons, arming you for future encounters.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576460/extras/f63356c2250b97779d801481885f5fca.avif?t=1720208305\" width=700 height=376 /></span>",
