h=700 height=584 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAP REWARDS, FORGE DESTINY</h2>With each run, your performance reaps its rewards in the form of credits. These valuable credits can be strategically employed to unlock permanent abilities and procure new weapons, arming you for future encounters.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576460/extras/f63356c2250b97779d801481885f5fca.avif?t=1720208305\" width=700 height=376 /></span>",
